<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result and close of play score in four-day Sheffield Shield matches on Friday:</p>
<p>In Hobart: Tasmania beat South Australia by five wickets. South Australia 387 (Ben Johnson 91, Joe Scuderi 70) and 209-5 declared (Geoff Parker 68 not out), Tasmania 248 (Ricky Ponting 126, Joe Scuderi 5-43) and 351-5 (Ricky Ponting 145 not out).</p>
<p>In Perth (day one): Western Australia 317-3 (Murray Goodwin 125 not out) v Queensland.</p>
